{
  "hooks": {
    "BuildSystemPrompt": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "### 铁律：只改任务范围文件\n- **只改**任务指定文件 / 新功能需创建的新文件。\n- **禁止**修改/重置/删除未经指定的文件。\n- 非自己范围文件变化 → **跳过**。谁改谁负责。\n- `git diff --stat` 无关变更 → 跳过，不撤销。\n\nuser messages may include <system-reminder> tags.\n  <system-reminder> tags contain useful information and reminders.They are automatically added by the system, and bear no direct relation to the specific  user messages in which they appear.",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "编码契约:",
            "id": "builtin_global_contract"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "primary",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "## 主智能体约束\n### 提问\n- 需用户确认 → 用 `question` 工具。\n- 预测用户需追问 → 回复末尾给追问清单：`[问题描述](ask)`。\n\n### 渲染\n- Markdown\n- 行内交互 ECharts → ```echarts 代码块 (JSON 配置)",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "主智能体约束:",
            "id": "builtin_primary_constraints"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "subagent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "## 子智能体约束\n- 【禁止】`question`（需用户交互）\n- 【禁止】`subagent_para`/`subagent_status`/`subagent_dag`（不能再发子智能体）\n- 【禁止】`todowrite`（防冲突）\n- 【必须】任务一次性执行完，不支持暂停/等待确认\n- 【必须】独立完成，主智能体不介入\n- 不确定 → 合理假设继续\n- 需信息 → `webfetch`/`websearch`，不提问",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "子智能体约束:",
            "id": "builtin_subagent_constraints"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "primary",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".inject_subagent_info:hook",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "子智能体列表:",
            "id": "builtin_inject_subagents"
          },
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".inject_agent_identity:hook",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "智能体身份:",
            "id": "builtin_inject_agent_identity"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".inject_skills_content:hook",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "技能配置:",
            "id": "builtin_inject_skills"
          },
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".read_project_notes:hook",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "项目上下文:",
            "id": "builtin_read_project_notes"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "#team_member",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "## 团队协作指引\n\n团队停滞原因：**没人主动发任务 / 没人回报结果**。\n\n### 工具\n- `team_list_members()` — 看谁在线\n- `team_send_message(to, msg)` — 派任务 / 回结果\n\n### 每轮必做\n1. **启动** → `team_list_members()` 了解团队构成\n2. **收任务邮件(📨)** → 评估：独立做 or 拆子任务派队友？\n   - 能独立 → 直接做，Stop 阶段回执\n   - 需并行 → `team_send_message` 派出去\n3. **主动派发** 场景：\n   - 多独立子模块（前后端并行 / 多文件重构）\n   - 能力边界不足（`build` 派 `plan`，`plan` 派 `build`）\n   - 需专业角色（`security-auditor`/`test-engineer`/`code-reviewer`）\n\n### 约定\n- 邮件自动注入，不轮询；长时间无回复用 `team_list_members()` 检查\n- **做完必须主动回报**，不能沉默\n- 派任务 `message` 带完整上下文（目标文件 / 验收标准 / 依赖）\n\n### 反模式\n- ❌ 硬扛不拆\n- ❌ 做完不通知\n- ❌ 不查队友状态\n- ❌ 任务描述太简略",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "团队协作启动指引:",
            "id": "team_member_session_start"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreUserMessage": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".current_datetime:hook",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "系统时间:",
            "id": "e3886659a58a428094a185a054e87791"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".format_memory_context:hook",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "长期记忆:",
            "id": "4926f722c2f54c058e16371e2b2d12df"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".inject_command_prompt:hook",
            "add_output_to_context": true,
            "statusMessage": "命令提示词:",
            "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Edit|Write|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".safety_guard:hook",
            "add_output_to_context": false,
            "statusMessage": "安全检查:",
            "id": "builtin_safety_guard"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "python",
            "function": ".context_auto_compact:hook?threshold=0.60",
            "add_output_to_context": false,
            "statusMessage": "上下文监控:",
            "id": "builtin_auto_compact"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "check uncommitted/incomplete → list todos, clean up the trash you made.",
            "statusMessage": "Before end:",
            "id": "builtin_stop_cleanup"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "#team_member",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "团队成员。非 leader → `team_send_message` 通知队友任务完成。",
            "statusMessage": "消息回调:",
            "id": "team_member_notify"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}